Able to be used effectively as both a Main DPS and a burst dual DPS;

 Versatile teams with many options available;

 Simplistic in playstyle with easy rotations to perform;

 Damage can be frontloaded to finish enemies off quickly — low-cooldown

 Ultimate and signature Echo nukes with very high damage;

 Sword user with lots of viable and commonly obtained 5-star options available:

 They and their sequences are free and make building them easy!

One of the longest Main DPS on-field times in the game;

 Falls behind limited options as a Dual DPS due to a long Forte buildup;

 Low AoE potential outside of big nukes that have cooldowns.
